barl\"><i style=\"width:1.5466666666666669%\"></i><em style=\"left:86.66666666666667%\"></em></span><span class=\"num\" style=\"text-align:right\">1.2%</span></div></div></div></div>\n    <div class=\"res\" id=\"res\"><div class=\"panel\"><div class=\"target\" data-act=\"pickmob\" title=\"เปลี่ยนมอนเป้าหมาย\" style=\"cursor:pointer\"><span class=\"tm\"><img class=\"px\" src=\"https://wiki.bindertowngame.com/img/mob/gale_wisp.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></span><div style=\"min-width:0;flex:1\"><div class=\"small muted\">ตีใส่</div><b style=\"font:600 15px var(--display)\">Gale Wisp</b> <span class=\"tag\">Lv 61</span><div class=\"small muted\">HP 13,347 · ทั่วไป</div></div><button class=\"btn sm ghost\" data-act=\"pickmob\">เปลี่ยน</button></div></div>\n  <div class=\"panel\"><div class=\"resbig\"><div class=\"st hi\"><span>DPS (รอบสกิล)</span><b>11,863</b></div><div class=\"st hi\"><span>ฆ่าตัวนี้ใน</span><b>1.1 วิ</b></div><div class=\"st\"><span>ต่อฮิต · Shield Bash</span><b>12,336</b></div><div class=\"st\"><span>ตีธรรมดา DPS</span><b>1,498</b></div>\n    <div class=\"st blue\"><span>HP</span><b>6,015</b></div><div class=\"st blue\"><span>โดนตีกี่ทีตาย</span><b>118.4</b></div><div class=\"st blue\"><span>โดนจริงต่อที</span><b>77</b></div><div class=\"st blue\"><span>ยืนรับได้</span><b>106.6 วิ</b></div></div>\n    <a class=\"btn gold\" style=\"width:100%;margin-top:10px\" href=\"https://wiki.bindertowngame.com/dmg\">⚔ ลองตีหุ่น ดูดาเมจแต่ละท่า</a></div>\n  <div class=\"panel\"><h3>ดาเมจมาจากไหน <span class=\"r small muted\">รอบ 60 วิ</span></h3><div class=\"share\"><i style=\"width:39.86089580524528%;background:#2f74e0\" title=\"Shield Bash\"></i><i style=\"width:22.445028645847632%;background:#f0a92c\" title=\"Bulwark Slam\"></i><i style=\"width:18.906920562965848%;background:#2fa36b\" title=\"Judgment Blade\"></i><i style=\"width:10.728533105065816%;background:#7c4ddb\" title=\"ตีธรรมดา\"></i><i style=\"width:7.974475197629556%;background:#e5484d\" title=\